---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-dark text-white gold-accent-top">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl inline-block px-5 py-3 mb-6">
          <img src="/images/logo-theraplay.png" alt="TheraPlay LA" class="h-14 w-auto" />
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-md">
          A leading pediatric therapy clinic in Los Angeles specializing in occupational, speech,
          feeding, and orofacial myofunctional therapy. We look beyond symptoms to address the root
          causes impacting your child's development — so every child can become the best version of themselves.
        </p>
        <p class="eyebrow-script">As seen on CBS News Los Angeles, Voyage LA &amp; ShoutOut LA</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-brand-primary-light font-heading text-lg mb-6">Quick Links</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/services" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">All Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services/occupational-therapy" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Occupational Therapy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services/speech-therapy" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Speech Therapy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services/feeding-therapy" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Feeding Therapy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services/intensives" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Therapy Intensives</a></li>
          <li><a href="/team" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Meet the Team</a></li>
          <li><a href="/our-space" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors text-sm">Explore Our Space</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-brand-primary-light font-heading text-lg mb-6">Visit Us</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/70">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-brand-secondary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            <span>1070 S La Brea Ave<br/>Los Angeles, CA 90019</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-secondary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/></svg>
            <a href="tel:+14243924568" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors">(424) 392-4568</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-secondary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
            <a href="mailto:hello@theraplayla.com" class="text-white/70 hover:text-brand-secondary transition-colors">hello@theraplayla.com</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Founded by Dr. Marielly Mitchell, OTD, OTR/L, SIPT, SWC<br/>Regional Center vendor · Serving LA &amp; beyond via teletherapy</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs text-white/40">&copy; {year} TheraPlay LA. All rights reserved. · Website mockup concept</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
